1
00:00:00,190 --> 00:00:00,950
Wink.

2
00:00:00,950 --> 00:00:01,500
Keep your other eye

3
00:00:02,130 --> 00:00:03,100
STILL.

4
00:00:03,144 --> 00:00:04,533
It moved, right?

5
00:00:04,590 --> 00:00:05,640
Relax.

6
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:06,633
Your two eyelids

7
00:00:06,664 --> 00:00:09,267
share ONE string.

8
00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:09,910
Blink.

9
00:00:09,910 --> 00:00:10,800
That pulls it...

10
00:00:10,841 --> 00:00:12,533
and BOTH lids drop.

11
00:00:12,581 --> 00:00:13,470
A wink?

12
00:00:13,470 --> 00:00:14,600
That's pulling it...

13
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:16,600
while holding one lid UP.

14
00:00:16,652 --> 00:00:18,185
But then your grip

15
00:00:18,185 --> 00:00:19,000
slips.

16
00:00:19,032 --> 00:00:20,260
In one study,

17
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:21,331
ninety-six people

18
00:00:21,331 --> 00:00:22,533
out of a hundred...

19
00:00:22,560 --> 00:00:24,333
squinted too.

20
00:00:24,390 --> 00:00:26,684
Now try the OTHER eye.

